household.description:
Select or create a Home Assistant Person for each household member, including pets. Then HomeCircle will ask you to assign a location tracker and configure that member. A new tracker is linked to the selected Home Assistant Person when you save. To connect Life360 directly, turn on its connection; after its trackers appear, add members from Options. Primary family home and each member’s other homes count as Home. Places such as work label Away locations. Create a missing Person or zone here without losing your choices.

{new_person_hint}
{new_zone_hint}
{tracker_status}

