The map source note reflects the selections when this screen opened; the review updates after you submit.

To add a missing other-home zone, choose Create another home zone. {new_zone_hint}

confirm.description:
Review these selections before saving. HomeCircle uses the selected Home Assistant entities. If you connected a tracker account directly, its trackers may appear after setup; reopen Options to choose people from them.

**Primary home:** {primary_home}

**Places shown while Away:** {places}

{members}

Choose Back to revisit the last member, Edit a member to jump to another member, or Save household. Closing discards the draft. After saving, HomeCircle creates a dashboard when one does not already exist.

