household.description:
Select Home Assistant People for your household, including pets. For a new member, create or choose the Person first, then assign a tracker and configure that member. Use Person and tracker settings for one existing member. Existing tracker-only members are kept until you convert them; the older lists appear only while those members remain. Primary home, other homes and places can be changed here.

{new_person_hint}
